@startuml UC002_ViewNote_Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' Color palette: boundary=blue, service=green, domain=amber, repo=lavender, infra=gray
actor "User" as U
participant "«boundary»\nHTTP Route\n(router.py)" as API #E6F0FB
participant "«service»\nNoteService" as SERV #E7F4EA
participant "«repository»\nSQLAlchemyNoteRepository" as REPO #EEE7F7
database "SQLite / PostgreSQL\n(notes table)" as DB #ECECEC

== Phase 1: Request arrives ==

U -> API : 1.1 GET /api/v1/notes/{note_id}
note over API
  FastAPI parses note_id as UUID.
  If malformed → 422 (before service is called).
end note

API -> API : 1.2 Resolve dependencies:\n  session, user_id (placeholder),\n  NoteService

== Phase 2: Service loads the note ==

API -> SERV : 2.1 get_note(user_id, note_id)
SERV -> REPO : 2.2 find_by_id(note_id)
REPO -> DB : 2.3 session.get(NoteORM, note_id)\n     (SELECT by primary key)
DB --> REPO : NoteORM | None
REPO -> REPO : 2.4 note_from_orm(orm)\n  (skipped if None)
REPO --> SERV : Note | None

== Phase 3: Info-hiding authorization ==

alt Note is None (doesn't exist)
  SERV --> API : raise NoteNotFoundError
  API --> U : 3.1' 404 "Note not found"
else Note.user_id != requesting user_id
  SERV --> API : raise NoteNotFoundError
  API --> U : 3.1'' 404 "Note not found"
  note right
    Same response as "not found"
    to prevent enumeration attacks
  end note
else Note.is_deleted is True (trashed)
  SERV --> API : raise NoteNotFoundError
  API --> U : 3.1''' 404 "Note not found"
else Happy path — note found, owned, not deleted
  SERV --> API : 3.2 Note (aggregate)
end

== Phase 4: Convert & respond ==

API -> API : 4.1 Convert Note → NoteDTO\n  (unwrap VOs, drop user_id & is_deleted)
API --> U : 4.2 200 OK + NoteDTO

note across
  Latency budget: < 100ms
    - Route dispatch + UUID validation: ~5ms
    - Repo lookup (indexed PK): ~30ms
    - Authorization checks: ~1ms
    - DTO conversion: ~1ms
    Total backend: ~37ms ✓
end note

@enduml
